# SEO SOVEREIGNTY: INFINITY PROTOCOL v6.2

> Consolidates `seo_governance.mdc`. One rule, absolute authority.

## 1. METADATA API (Next.js App Router)
```typescript
// Every page MUST export generateMetadata
export async function generateMetadata({ params }): Promise<Metadata> {
  return {
    title: `${product.name} | Brand`,
    description: product.description.slice(0, 160),
    openGraph: { images: [{ url: product.imageUrl }] },
    alternates: { canonical: `https://domain.com/${params.slug}` },
  };
}
```

## 2. SCHEMA.ORG (schema-dts)
- Use `schema-dts` for all structured data. No raw JSON-LD strings.
- Required schemas: `Organization` (root), `Product` (commerce), `Article` (blog), `BreadcrumbList` (nav).

## 3. TECHNICAL SEO MANDATES
- **Sitemap**: Dynamic `app/sitemap.ts` — auto-generates from Firestore/CMS data.
- **Robots**: `app/robots.ts` — block `/admin*`, `/api*`, `/dashboard*`.
- **Canonical**: Always set. Trailing-slash consistency enforced (Rule 17).
- **Core Web Vitals**: LCP < 2.5s, CLS < 0.1, INP < 200ms. Non-negotiable.

## 4. IMAGE SEO
- ALL `<img>` → `next/image` with `alt`, `width`, `height`.
- WebP/AVIF format mandatory.
- Preload hero images via `priority` prop.

## 5. FORBIDDEN PATTERNS
- Duplicate `<title>` tags.
- Missing `alt` attributes.
- `noindex` on public content pages.
- Blocking Googlebot in `robots.ts`.
